.PS
# basic/dc2src.cir drawn: two sources summed into R3 through 1k and 2k
# (Millman: v(vx) = (2 v1 + v2)/5), then an inverting VCVS (x-1.5)
# into R4, swept over both sources. Card order kept; deck nodes 1 V1n,
# 2 V2n, 3 Vx, 4 Vout.
spice = 1
V1n:  (0.3,2)
V2n:  (2.9,2)
Vx:   (1.6,2)
Vout: (4.4,2)

V1: vsource(V1n, (0.3,0), dc 0)
V2: vsource(V2n, (2.9,0), dc 0)
R1: resistor(V1n, Vx, 1k)
R2: resistor(V2n, Vx, 2k)
R3: resistor(Vx, (1.6,0), 1k)
E1: vcvs(Vout, (4.4,0), (3.9,1.2), (3.9,0.8), -1.5)
R4: resistor((5.6,2), (5.6,0), 1k)

line from Vx to (1.6,2.6) then to (3.6,2.6) then to (3.6,1.2) then to E1.Cp
line from E1.Cn to (3.6,0.8) then to (3.6,0)
line from E1.P to R4.P
line from V1.N to R4.N
dot at Vx; dot at R3.N; dot at V2.N; dot at (3.6,0); dot at E1.N
ground((0.95,0))
.dc v1 0 1 0.25 v2 0 2 0.5
.PE
